        "id": "12595131",
        "text": "\"Doesn't this vegetarian restaurant look good? Let’s try it today!\" \"I'm in the mood for meat, though.\" \"But didn’t we have yakiniku yesterday?\" \"Yesterday was yesterday; today is today. Besides, I could eat meat every day.\" \"Forget it. I'll ask someone else. See you later.\""
